  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - No development shall take place until details of screening to balconies and samples of the materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the hereby permitted have been submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority.  Development shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details",
    "Condition : 3 - No development shall take place until details of screening to balconies and samples of the materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the hereby permitted have been submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority.  Development shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details",
    "Condition : 4 - 4.\tThe use hereby permitted shall not be begun until details of cycle parking have been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority.  The cycle parking shall not be carried out otherwise than in accordance with any approval given and shall be completed before any part of the accommodation hereby permitted is occupied",
    "Condition : 5 - 5.\tNo dwelling shall be occupied until there has been submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority a plan indicating the positions, design, materials and type of boundary treatment to be erected. These details shall include a wooden fence of at least 1.8 m along the south-western site boundary. Development shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details",
    "Condition : 6 - 6.\tPrior to commencement of development a Sustainability Statement shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority to demonstrate the proposed scheme shall meet the carbon emission reduction and sustainable design requirements set out within the London Plan.  The scheme shall be implemented in accordance with these approved details.",
    "Condition : 7 - No dwelling shall be occupied until further details of the car parking facilities have been submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority. These details shall include the location of electrical charging points. Development shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details and retained for this sole purpose thereafter"
  ],
